    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2418\"><em data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2418\">(10th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2468\">You cast across groups through shared symbolism.</p><p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2499\">Choose a collective identity:</p><ul data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2556\"><li data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2508\"><p data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2508\">Crowd</p></li><li data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2514\"><p data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2514\">Mob</p></li><li data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2522\"><p data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2522\">Choir</p></li><li data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2529\"><p data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2529\">Army</p></li><li data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2544\"><p data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2544\">Congregation</p></li><li data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2556\"><p data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2556\">Survivors</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2612\">You may affect the group as a unified symbolic system:</p><ul data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2683\"><li data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2633\"><p data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2633\">Shared illusion</p></li><li data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2649\"><p data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2649\">Shared fear</p></li><li data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2665\"><p data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2665\">Shared calm</p></li><li data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2683\"><p data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2683\">Shared belief</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2719\">It feels like fate—not domination.</p><h3 data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2746\">Resonance Interaction</h3><p data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2797\">Group alignment can generate additional Resonance.</p><h3 data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2807\">Risk</h3><p data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2856\">If the shared metaphor fractures, Strain spikes.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
